      "High polymer concentration provides genuine structural stability in joints up to 2-3 inches wide",
      "Handles large flagstone and irregular natural stone joints without shrinking or cracking as it cures",
      "Strong resistance to erosion from heavy, sustained rainfall",
      "50-lb professional bags keep material cost per square foot competitive on big jobs",
      "Minimal shrinkage across a full cure cycle, even in deep joints",
